 "name_en": "Intercompany Foreign Exchange Management (2F2)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Intercompany Foreign Exchange Management (2F2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item allows a company to exchange foreign currency with affiliate companies. The contracts and deals are mirrored automatically. These intercompany transactions can be posted into the leading accounting principle.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create FX spot/forward – intercompany transaction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create FX swap – intercompany transaction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create nondeliverable forward – intercompany transaction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check mirror transaction (optional)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create foreign exchange transactions with affiliate companies easily</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>公司间外汇管理 (2F2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许公司与关联公司兑换外币。合同和交易自动镜像。这些公司间交易可以过账到主要会计准则。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建外汇即期/远期 - 公司间交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建外汇掉期 - 公司间交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建无本金交割远期 - 公司间交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查镜像交易（可选）</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio120fa6fa0c7e4c488c7ed68a63bcc2ac__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松创建与联营公司的外汇交易</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
